Reference data for PointGriddingTest, generated by make_reference.py of the
Python prototype (~/hub/obs-gridding).

Grid: x0=3900000.0 y0=2350000.0 dx=2500.0 nx=240 ny=200 (EPSG:3035),
rows from south to north.

dem.f32               terrain heights (m), float32, ETOPO 2022 (NOAA, public domain)
stations.csv          synthetic stations: a valley inversion up to 1200 m, normal lapse
                      rate above, a TPI effect, a gentle gradient, 0.5 K noise and three
                      gross errors (stations 10, 50 and 200)
expected_grid.f32     analysis with the default Options, float32
expected_stations.csv analysis at the stations and the gross error flags
